    "text": "Peer-reported custody_group_count must be validated against NUMBER_OF_CUSTODY_GROUPS upper bound before use in any loop or data structure sizing. handle_custody_groups must terminate in O(NUMBER_OF_CUSTODY_GROUPS) iterations regardless of the peer-advertised value.",
    "assertion": "forall peer_cgc: handle_custody_groups(peer_cgc, ...) terminates AND iterations <= NUMBER_OF_CUSTODY_GROUPS, even when peer_cgc > NUMBER_OF_CUSTODY_GROUPS",
